  "meta": {
    "document": "Arlington County VA FY2027 Adopted Budget",
    "title": "Arlington County — the money trail",
    "grand_total": 1024492896,
    "year": 2027,
    "note": "Arlington County, Virginia — an urban county across the Potomac from Washington, D.C., with no incorporated towns inside it. This tree is the General Fund operating budget by department, $1.02 billion, from the adopted budget resolution. On top of this the county transfers about $838 million to Arlington Public Schools and runs other funds; the all-funds county budget is about $2.24 billion. Human Services and Environmental Services are the largest departments. Every figure ties to the FY2027 appropriations resolution and foots to the dollar."
  },
